51
00:01:34,250 --> 00:01:35,840
Let's start with the most basic

52
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:38,000
structure: the Sole Proprietorship.

53
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:40,440
For many, this is the simplest way to

54
