74
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:19,260
Next, we have the Limited Liability

75
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,870
Company, or LLC.

76
00:02:21,580 --> 00:02:23,580
This is one of the most popular choices

77
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,200
for small service businesses.

78
00:02:25,550 --> 00:02:28,430
An LLC creates a legal entity that is

79
00:02:28,490 --> 00:02:30,790
