83
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:38,140
flexibility, and manageable

84
00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:39,500
administrative formalities.

85
00:02:39,740 --> 00:02:42,030
One of the biggest advantages of an LLC

86
00:02:42,350 --> 00:02:43,780
is its tax flexibility.

87
00:02:43,870 --> 00:02:46,460
By default, the IRS sees a single-member

88
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:48,450
LLC in a specific way.

89
00:02:48,650 --> 00:02:50,490
It is generally 'disregarded' for

90
00:02:50,550 --> 00:02:52,790
