92
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:55,590
initial filings.

93
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:58,810
A multi-member LLC is typically treated

94
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:00,700
as a partnership, though you can later

95
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,720
