100
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,980
That means separate banking, meticulous

101
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:14,660
record-keeping, and disciplined

102
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:17,200
operations are non-negotiable for your

103
00:03:17,250 --> 00:03:17,870
protection.

104
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:20,380
Finally, let's look at the Corporation.

105
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,680
This is the most formal and structured

106
00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:24,470
